# ── .dockerignore ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keeps Docker build context small and fast by excluding heavy / irrelevant
# paths. Anything matched here is NOT sent to the Docker daemon during build.

# Node / pnpm
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.local
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/.cache

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# IDE / editor
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store

# Logs / tmp
**/*.log
**/tmp
**/.tmp

# Environment (don't bake secrets into images — mount at runtime instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example

# Project-specific bloat
**/attached_assets
**/mockup-sandbox
**/coverage
**/.next
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Docs / metadata that aren't needed at runtime
**/README.md
**/replit.md
**/.replit
**/replit.nix
